Please hand in by ",
    FontSize->12,
    FontWeight->"Bold"],
  StyleBox["Monday, 26 October",
    FontSize->12,
    FontWeight->"Bold",
    FontColor->GrayLevel[0]],
  StyleBox[".\nSave it in your subdirectory of\nthe class handin directory.",
    FontSize->12,
    FontWeight->"Bold"]
}], "Subsubtitle",
  FontColor->RGBColor[1, 0, 0]],

Cell[TextData[StyleBox["Name: xxxxxxxxx",
  FontSize->16]], "Subsubtitle"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[{
  "1. Tangents to a conic ",
  StyleBox["[25 points]",
    FontColor->RGBColor[1, 0, 0]]
}], "Subsection",
  Evaluatable->False,
  AspectRatioFixed->False],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[{
  "Question 1 ",
  StyleBox["[15 points]",
    FontColor->RGBColor[1, 0, 0]]
}], "Subsubsection"],

Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["Question 1.  ",
    FontWeight->"Bold"],
  "Suppose ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      StyleBox["f",
        FontWeight->"Bold"]]],
  " is a conic",
  StyleBox[" ",
    FontWeight->"Bold"],
  "and",
  StyleBox[" ",
    FontWeight->"Bold"],
  Cell[BoxData[
      StyleBox["p",
        FontWeight->"Bold"]]],
  " is a point.  Prove that the following expression is a ",
  StyleBox["degenerate conic",
    FontWeight->"Bold",
    FontSlant->"Italic"],
  " representing the ",
  StyleBox["two tangents",
    FontWeight->"Bold",
    FontSlant->"Italic"],
  " to the conic ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      StyleBox["f",
        FontWeight->"Bold"]]],
  StyleBox[" ",
    FontWeight->"Bold"],
  "from the point ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      StyleBox["p",
        FontWeight->"Bold"]]],
  ":  \n\t\t\t",
  Cell[BoxData[
      StyleBox[\(PD[f, p]\^2 - 2\ f\ PD[f, p\^2]\),
        FontWeight->"Bold"]]],
  "."
}], "Text",
  Evaluatable->False,
  AspectRatioFixed->False,
  Background->RGBColor[0, 1, 1]],

Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["Comment: ",
    FontWeight->"Bold"],
  "In case ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      StyleBox["p",
        FontWeight->"Bold"]]],
  " is on ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      StyleBox["f",
        FontWeight->"Bold"]]],
  ", the result is the ",
  StyleBox["square of the tangent ",
    FontWeight->"Bold",
    FontSlant->"Italic"],
  "at ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      StyleBox["p",
        FontWeight->"Bold"]]],
  StyleBox[". ",
    FontWeight->"Bold"],
  " (Why?)  We remark that the formula is a",
  StyleBox[" ",
    FontWeight->"Bold"],
  StyleBox["rational expression",
    FontWeight->"Bold",
    FontSlant->"Italic"],
  "  in terms of the coefficients of the conic and the coordinates of the \
point.  This is true even though the actual ",
  StyleBox["finding",
    FontWeight->"Bold",
    FontSlant->"Italic"],
  " of the tangents themselves may involve the taking of ",
  StyleBox["roots",
    FontWeight->"Bold",
    FontSlant->"Italic"],
  "."
}], "Text",
  Evaluatable->False,
  AspectRatioFixed->False,
  Background->RGBColor[0, 1, 0]]
}, Closed]],

Cell[TextData[StyleBox["Answer",
  FontWeight->"Bold",
  FontColor->RGBColor[1, 0, 0]]], "Subsubsection",
  FontColor->RGBColor[1, 0, 0]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[{
  "Question 2 ",
  StyleBox["[10 points]",
    FontColor->RGBColor[1, 0, 0]]
}], "Subsubsection"],

Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["Question 2.",
    FontWeight->"Bold"],
  "  Draw a ",
  StyleBox["picture",
    FontWeight->"Bold",
    FontSlant->"Italic"],
  " to illustrate the theorem for a specific conic and a specific point.  And \
try to ",
  StyleBox["factor",
    FontWeight->"Bold",
    FontSlant->"Italic"],
  " the degenerate conic.  (Do not make this ",
  StyleBox["too easy",
    FontWeight->"Bold",
    FontSlant->"Italic"],
  "!)"
}], "Text",
  Background->RGBColor[0, 1, 1]]
}, Closed]],

Cell[TextData[StyleBox["Answer",
  FontWeight->"Bold",
  FontColor->RGBColor[1, 0, 0]]], "Subsubsection",
  FontColor->RGBColor[1, 0, 0]]
}, Closed]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[{
  "2. Degenerate conics ",
  StyleBox["[25 points]",
    FontColor->RGBColor[1, 0, 0]]
}], "Subsection",
  Evaluatable->False,
  AspectRatioFixed->False],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[{
  "Question 1 ",
  StyleBox["[15 points]",
    FontColor->RGBColor[1, 0, 0]]
}], "Subsubsection"],

Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["Question 1.  ",
    FontWeight->"Bold"],
  "The problem is to ",
  StyleBox["factor",
    FontWeight->"Bold",
    FontSlant->"Italic"],
  " a degenerate conic.  Here is its Hessian matrix of a ",
  StyleBox["general",
    FontWeight->"Bold",
    FontSlant->"Italic"],
  " degenerate conic:"
}], "Text",
  Evaluatable->False,
  AspectRatioFixed->False,
  Background->RGBColor[0, 1, 1]],

Cell["\<\
ClearAll[a,b,c,d,e,f];
MHP[(a x + b y + c z)(d x + e y + f z)] // MatrixForm\
\>", "Input"],

Cell[TextData[{
  "Given ",
  StyleBox["any",
    FontWeight->"Bold",
    FontSlant->"Italic"],
  " conic ",
  StyleBox["f",
    FontWeight->"Bold"],
  ", set the ",
  StyleBox["MHP[f]",
    FontWeight->"Bold"],
  " equal to the explicit Hessian above and solve for the coefficients.   If \
it works, the polynomial factors.  ",
  StyleBox["Write a program to do this.",
    FontWeight->"Bold",
    FontSlant->"Italic"]
}], "Text",
  Evaluatable->False,
  AspectRatioFixed->False,
  Background->RGBColor[0, 1, 1]]
}, Closed]],

Cell[TextData[StyleBox["Answer",
  FontWeight->"Bold",
  FontColor->RGBColor[1, 0, 0]]], "Subsubsection",
  FontColor->RGBColor[1, 0, 0]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[{
  "Question 2 ",
  StyleBox["[10 points]",
    FontColor->RGBColor[1, 0, 0]]
}], "Subsubsection"],

Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["Question 2. ",
    FontWeight->"Bold"],
  " Can you give your program some convincing ",
  StyleBox["tests",
    FontWeight->"Bold",
    FontSlant->"Italic"],
  "?"
}], "Text",
  Background->RGBColor[0, 1, 1]]
}, Closed]],

Cell[TextData[StyleBox["Answer",
  FontWeight->"Bold",
  FontColor->RGBColor[1, 0, 0]]], "Subsubsection",
  FontColor->RGBColor[1, 0, 0]]
}, Closed]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[{
  "3. Multiple points ",
  StyleBox["[20 points]",
    FontColor->RGBColor[1, 0, 0]]
}], "Subsection"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[{
  "Question 1 ",
  StyleBox["[5 points]",
    FontColor->RGBColor[1, 0, 0]]
}], "Subsubsection"],

Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["Question 1.   ",
    FontWeight->"Bold"],
  "Show that ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      StyleBox[\(f = x\^6 - x\ y\^2\ z\^3 - y\^3\ z\^3 - \(y\^3\) x\^3\),
        FontWeight->"Bold"]]],
  " is a ",
  StyleBox["6",
    FontWeight->"Bold"],
  "th-degree curve with a ",
  StyleBox["triple point",
    FontWeight->"Bold",
    FontSlant->"Italic"],
  " at the origin."
}], "Text",
  Background->RGBColor[0, 1, 1]]
}, Closed]],

Cell[TextData[StyleBox["Answer",
  FontWeight->"Bold",
  FontColor->RGBColor[1, 0, 0]]], "Subsubsection",
  FontColor->RGBColor[1, 0, 0]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[{
  "Question 2 ",
  StyleBox["[5 points]",
    FontColor->RGBColor[1, 0, 0]]
}], "Subsubsection"],

Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["Question 2.",
    FontWeight->"Bold"],
  "  What are the ",
  StyleBox["tangents",
    FontWeight->"Bold",
    FontSlant->"Italic"],
  " to the curve at the origin?  ",
  StyleBox["Draw a picture.",
    FontWeight->"Bold",
    FontSlant->"Italic"]
}], "Text",
  Background->RGBColor[0, 1, 1]]
}, Closed]],

Cell[TextData[StyleBox["Answer",
  FontWeight->"Bold",
  FontColor->RGBColor[1, 0, 0]]], "Subsubsection",
  FontColor->RGBColor[1, 0, 0]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[{
  "Question 3 ",
  StyleBox["[10 points]",
    FontColor->RGBColor[1, 0, 0]]
}], "Subsubsection"],

Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["Question 3.",
    FontWeight->"Bold"],
  "  Are there ",
  StyleBox["any other",
    FontWeight->"Bold",
    FontSlant->"Italic"],
  " multiple points on the curve?"
}], "Text",
  Background->RGBColor[0, 1, 1]]
}, Closed]],

Cell[TextData[StyleBox["Answer",
  FontWeight->"Bold",
  FontColor->RGBColor[1, 0, 0]]], "Subsubsection",
  FontColor->RGBColor[1, 0, 0]]
}, Closed]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[{
  "4. Tangents to a cubic ",
  StyleBox["[30 points]",
    FontColor->RGBColor[1, 0, 0]]
}], "Subsection"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[{
  "Question 1 ",
  StyleBox["[25 points]",
    FontColor->RGBColor[1, 0, 0]]
}], "Subsubsection"],

Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["Question 1.",
    FontWeight->"Bold"],
  "  How many ",
  StyleBox["tangents",
    FontWeight->"Bold",
    FontSlant->"Italic"],
  " to the cubic ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      StyleBox[\(f = x\^3 + y\^3 - x\ y\ z\),
        FontWeight->"Bold"]]],
  " are there from the point ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      StyleBox[\(p = u + v + w\),
        FontWeight->"Bold"]]],
  " ?  ",
